  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kenya Elections Preparedness</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is an anticipatory action to election related violence and displacement. Assistance to affected and displaced populations shall be made through delivery of Multi Purpose Cash Assistance, support to Sexual and Gender Based Violence (SGBV) survivors and such other support as may be required and funded for. Oxfam and partners will strengthen coordination during emergencies for effective response in order to save lives.</narrative>
  </description>
